{"id":"aumento","lemma":"aumento","pos":"noun","rank":2489,"glosses":["increase","raise"],"ipa":"/auˈmento/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"aumentos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-aumento.wav","examples":[{"text":"Necesito un aumento.","en":"I need a raise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440836","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"No me han dado un aumento.","en":"I didn't get a raise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/630215","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a die or dice"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Me van a dar un gran aumento.","en":"I'm getting a big raise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587441","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"van"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to give, to give out"},{"g":"a"},null,null]},{"text":"Pedí un aumento.","en":"I asked for a raise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333261","words":[{"g":"to ask for something","l":"pedir"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"El precio de los huevos está en aumento.","en":"The price of eggs is going up.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"price"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"guts, balls"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},null]}]}